  "_comment": "Traits people are born with. Everyone has exactly one of the six work traits (kind 'work'): its talent multiplies their output in the trades it names (1.6 is far better than most), and people lean towards trades they have a gift for. Half of people also have a temper trait (kind 'temper'). outputMult scales all their work; priceStepMult and marginBonus shape how merchants price; extraVisits and extraFoodDays how people shop; jobChangeMult how readily they change work. about is shown to the player."
